{"id":"715fc2a2ad4968cc","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-bestfit.md","title":"Class constrained best fit","display":"df-bestfit — Class constrained best fit","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-bestfit","aliases":["27-df-bestfit"],"display":"df-bestfit — Class constrained best fit","depends_on":["[[27-df-fiterror]]","[[27-df-extension]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.4, BEST-FIT(C)","source_printed_pages":"548","source_pdf_pages":"572","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-bestfit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-bestfit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bestfit — Class constrained best fit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" href=\"?note=00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" title=\"27-df-fiterror\">27-df-fiterror</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.4, BEST-FIT(C)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"548"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"572"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；误差见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" href=\"?note=00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" title=\"27-df-fiterror\">27-df-fiterror</a>，扩张族见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Err}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Err}_n\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" href=\"?note=00d5aa0e1574d0b4\" title=\"27-df-fiterror\">27-df-fiterror</a> 的精确接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FitLabel}_n(f;T,F)\\coloneqq\\left(\\{a\\in T\\cup F\\mid f(a)=1\\},\\{a\\in T\\cup F\\mid f(a)=0\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FitLabel}_n(f;T,F)\\coloneqq\\left(\\{a\\in T\\cup F\\mid f(a)=1\\},\\{a\\in T\\cup F\\mid f(a)=0\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathcal K\\mid\\forall g\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Err}_n(f;T,F,w)\\leq\\mathrm{Err}_n(g;T,F,w)\\bigr)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathcal K\\mid\\forall g\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Err}_n(f;T,F,w)\\leq\\mathrm{Err}_n(g;T,F,w)\\bigr)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BFOutput}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(T&#39;,F&#39;,f)\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)\\land(T&#39;,F&#39;)=\\mathrm{FitLabel}_n(f;T,F)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BFOutput}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(T&#39;,F&#39;,f)\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)\\land(T&#39;,F&#39;)=\\mathrm{FitLabel}_n(f;T,F)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§12.4 Problem BEST-FIT(C)，印刷页 548 / PDF 第 572 页。与原书输出对应：T′、F′ 构成原样本并集的划分，f∈K∩Ext_n(T′,F′)，目标恰为原书的加权误分类和。此处把输出规范为函数及其诱导标签；不会引入额外重分类选择。K 为空时两个最优输出集合都为空；K 非空时，由有限布尔函数载体可取到最小误差。定义和输出对应已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-fiterror","status":"resolved","id":"00d5aa0e1574d0b4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-fiterror]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-fiterror","status":"resolved","id":"00d5aa0e1574d0b4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}$，$\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；误差见 [[27-df-fiterror]]，扩张族见 [[27-df-extension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}$，$\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；误差见 [[27-df-fiterror]]，扩张族见 [[27-df-extension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-fiterror","status":"resolved","id":"00d5aa0e1574d0b4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Err}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-fiterror]] 的精确接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Err}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FitLabel}_n(f;T,F)\\coloneqq\\left(\\{a\\in T\\cup F\\mid f(a)=1\\},\\{a\\in T\\cup F\\mid f(a)=0\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathcal K\\mid\\forall g\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Err}_n(f;T,F,w)\\leq\\mathrm{Err}_n(g;T,F,w)\\bigr)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BFOutput}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(T',F',f)\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{BestFit}_n(T,F,w;\\mathcal K)\\land(T',F')=\\mathrm{FitLabel}_n(f;T,F)\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1876,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-bestfit|df-bestfit — Class constrained best fit]]"},{"id":"f1791ff3e14b4575","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"可追踪的内部入口依次为 [[27-df-functionalequation]] 与 [[27-df-equationalclass]]，[[27-df-fiterror]] 与 [[27-df-bestfit]]，[[27-df-missingbits]] 与 [[27-df-missingextensions]]，以及 [[27-df-pbextension]]、[[27-df-pbmaxelim]]。它们的完整数学条件仍由各自的 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 给出，本摘要不增加新的数学前提。"},{"id":"c5415e6aa9a22f33","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{>0}$，$\\emptyset\\ne\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；最优函数族见 [[27-df-bestfit]]，扩张族见 [[27-df-extension]]。"},{"id":"988675a000b87840","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $U\\subseteq T_0\\cup F_0$；$\\mathrm{MinVC}_n,\\mathrm{IrredVC}_n$ 定义见 [[27-df-fitconflictgraph]]；最优函数族、递增函数类和扩张族分别见 [[27-df-bestfit]]、[[27-df-monotone]]、[[27-df-extension]]。$T_U,F_U,g_U$ 由下式给出。"},{"id":"0d2436bddbb5a667","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}$；最优函数族和误差见 [[27-df-bestfit]]。$f_*\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B$ 是下式定义的图。"},{"id":"5f303ca062e56280","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$w:T\\cup F\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}$，$\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$。记 $I=T\\cap F$，$T_0=T\\setminus F$，$F_0=F\\setminus T$，$w_0=w\\upharpoonright(T_0\\cup F_0)$；误差和最优函数族见 [[27-df-fiterror]]、[[27-df-bestfit]]。"}],"outgoing":["00d5aa0e1574d0b4","2080bf803b294b75"]}